    "status" : "generated",
    "div" : "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: ActorDefinition MadoImagingManifestResponder</b></p><a name=\"MadoImagingManifestResponder\"> </a><a name=\"hcMadoImagingManifestResponder\"> </a><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Actor: EuImagingReportResponder </b></td><td>Imaging Manifest Responder</td><td>Type: system </td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"3\"><div><p>This actor typically represents a system that provides access to radiology reports. Typically this would be systems like a Electronic Health Record (EHR), Radiology Information System (RIS) or a Picture Archiving and Communication System (PACS) that manages and provides access to Imaging Manifests.</p>\n</div></td></tr></table></div>"
